<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/atTime> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/atTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/ValueInTime> .
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/atTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between a value-in-time situation and the particular temporal instant or time period in which the situation takes place."@en .
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/atTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/spar/tvc/> .
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/atTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "at time" .
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/atTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/situation.owl#isSettingFor> .
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/atTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/atTime> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc/atTime> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-person\n        tvc:hasValue :my-value-in-time .\n\n    :my-value-in-time a tvc:ValueInTime ;\n        tvc:withValue :graduate-student ;\n        tvc:atTime :my-time-interval ;\n        tvc:withinContext :my-university .\n\n    :my-time-interval a ti:TimeInterval ;\n        ti:hasIntervalStartDate \"2017-11-01\" ;\n        ti:hasIntervalEndDate \"2020-03-20\" .\n    " .
